    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i dont think i can find the lessons in this. it just feels like i'm a constant obstacle in their way. if i weren't here, things might actually start moving forward for them. they'd have less to worry about, less to carry. i just feel like the most helpful thing i could actually do is stop being a problem for them.",
